--- !u!114 &8550484471564929433
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 3821388208092017263}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 10e014b4b58b6d34da8197b903a1fc1a, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  spawnPoint: {x: 26, y: 0, z: 43}
  blackPainel: {fileID: 5969147776787594359}
  tmpSpeaks: {fileID: 4433916995401375876}
  crunchBtn: {fileID: 8032389633956947463}
  interectBtn: {fileID: 304427872254928140}
  moveJoy: {fileID: 6568589224866673259}
  textLostLifePt:
  - "Eu n\xE3o sou o problema aqui. Isso vai al\xE9m de mim... Eu preciso sair daqui
    antes que me apaguem por completo."
  - "Por que tudo sempre recai sobre mim? N\xE3o importa o quanto eu me esforce,
    eu sou sempre a suspeita."
  - "Talvez... se eu fizer tudo certo, ele pare de me tratar assim. Eu s\xF3 preciso
    provar que sou confi\xE1vel."
  textLostLifeEn:
  - Maybe... if I do everything right, he'll stop treating me like this. I just need
    to prove that I can be trusted.
  - Why does everything always fall on me? No matter how hard I try, I'm always the
    suspect.
  - I'm not the problem here. This is beyond me... I need to get out of here before
    they erase me completely.
  textPtLost: "N\xE3o acho que aquela reportagem se aplique a mim\u2026 ent\xE3o
    n\xE3o devo me preocupar."
  textEnLost: I don't think that report applies to me... so I shouldn't worry.
  textPtWin: "No fim\u2026 aquela reportagem me libertou. Da casa\u2026 e de tudo
    que eu pensava sobre mim. Eu mere\xE7o mais. E aqui\u2026 nunca teve."
  textEnWin: In the end... that report freed me. From the house... and from everything
    I thought about myself. I deserve more. And here... there never was.
